# Fabricated answers used to smoke-test the elicitation instrument.
# Kept out of the repository deliberately: this study's central claim about
# itself is that every reported number came from a real experiment, and a
# committed file of invented BWM responses is exactly the artefact that gets
# mistaken for data later. One already did - see the removal of
# elicited_weights.json containing a single TESTDATA respondent.
docs/elicitation-test-answers.txt
